                                                "sense_id": "08aec0d9-a597-34df-864f-9220563fa421",
                                                "text": "Among the inner packings in use are expanded polystyrene (popcorn), plastic-encapsulated air (air bubbles), various types of paper products, foam-in-place, molded polystyrene, and corrugated partitions (egg crating)."
