                                                "text": "So the matter rested until the Cranbrook & Paddock Wood Company was incorporated on August 8, 1877, appropriately displaying a bunch of hops on its seal, for these had become the principal cash crop in the area."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
