                                                "sense_id": "80fd49e5-dc30-39f2-8893-660cf8cae4de",
                                                "text": "Seals were placed on the papal apartment on the third floor of the Apostolic Palace and on the apartment on the second floor of the Casa Santa Marta, where Pope Francis lived."
