                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ee80734b-e557-4941-81b1-95095822d2aa",
                                                "sense_id": "f23ba0bf-e2e9-3fd4-9b66-6a058f216516",
                                                "text": "seal one's destiny"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "584a5448-798a-4fab-a28f-97510df3b5d7",
                                                "sense_id": "f23ba0bf-e2e9-3fd4-9b66-6a058f216516",
                                                "text": "seal someone's fate"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fd47e745-7f51-4a7b-a8ed-08f5b88eea78",
                                                "sense_id": "f23ba0bf-e2e9-3fd4-9b66-6a058f216516",
                                                "text": "seal the job"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dbd117f8-660c-4a6f-aa93-10c6856f9987",
                                                "sense_id": "f23ba0bf-e2e9-3fd4-9b66-6a058f216516",
                                                "text": "England's first-half display contained much to admire but it was a sign of their wastefulness in front of goal that it took the injury-time intervention from Kane to seal victory."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d193a585-0266-3f62-a8aa-a0edffa4c045",
                                        "entry_id": "44c183cf-80e1-33bd-890b-60a0b9031fba",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To fix, as a piece of iron in a wall, with cement or plaster, etc."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "faf2f72a-9c2e-420a-9a4e-f9bc45a7b443",
                                                "sense_id": "d193a585-0266-3f62-a8aa-a0edffa4c045",
                                                "text": "Sealed to this wall by their rims were cazuelas ( earthenware bowls)."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dd248e99-1b61-4851-9642-bd278d9e9f42",
                                                "sense_id": "d193a585-0266-3f62-a8aa-a0edffa4c045",
                                                "text": "After testing is concluded and it has been determined that the drilled well is to be completed as a producing or fluid-injection well, or that operations are to be suspended, the final string of casing is placed in the well and sealed to the penetrated formation with cement."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7dee4f68-f8f0-4abc-836e-3679543bfc73",
                                                "sense_id": "d193a585-0266-3f62-a8aa-a0edffa4c045",
                                                "text": "The PVC was then sealed to the plastered foundation with a 3-inch-wide band of PVC-to-concrete adhesive applied above the Thiokol."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e4171455-eae9-47a4-a970-016706d323db",
                                                "sense_id": "d193a585-0266-3f62-a8aa-a0edffa4c045",
                                                "text": "The blowing device consists of a glass vessel with a hollow perforated cylinder sealed to its base, and two side tubes sealed at opposite ends of the vessel."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "85667ce8-8742-3fb1-9225-53bb1d8d5a74",
                                        "entry_id": "44c183cf-80e1-33bd-890b-60a0b9031fba",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To close by means of a seal."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "447a0708-f99d-4540-8f8a-4982ecfef8c0",
                                                "sense_id": "85667ce8-8742-3fb1-9225-53bb1d8d5a74",
                                                "text": "to seal a drainpipe with water"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ec515f21-8c9f-4a5e-8848-bef792d3416c",
                                                "sense_id": "85667ce8-8742-3fb1-9225-53bb1d8d5a74",
                                                "text": "When the silicone rubber has set the plaster pieces are replaced, followed by the lid, which is sealed to the mother-mould with plaster and bandage as previously described."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2fa7ba79-4a27-3123-a773-fc09a3f90131",
                                        "entry_id": "44c183cf-80e1-33bd-890b-60a0b9031fba",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To bind eternally as family members."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Mormonism"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3dcdff24-940f-4d61-bedd-a0f89820c569",
                                                "sense_id": "2fa7ba79-4a27-3123-a773-fc09a3f90131",
                                                "text": "If a man once married desires a second helpmate […] she is sealed to him under the solemn sanction of the church."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "94b52202-fe6d-4940-81ae-73ab4949cee0",
                                                "sense_id": "2fa7ba79-4a27-3123-a773-fc09a3f90131",
                                                "text": "She can be sealed to this other man and still remain with her first husband; and the Mormons believe that all her children will belong to the man to whom she is sealed."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "31694825-784a-415a-87e0-b950292ee6f5",
                                                "sense_id": "2fa7ba79-4a27-3123-a773-fc09a3f90131",
                                                "text": "Next, I was sealed to my fourteenth wife, Emeline Vaughn. In 1851, I was sealed to my fifteenth wife, Mary Lear Groves. In 1856, I was sealed to my sixteenth wife, Mary Ann Williams."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2db38bdc-347a-48b2-a1f3-a302a71ea6d3",
                                                "sense_id": "2fa7ba79-4a27-3123-a773-fc09a3f90131",
                                                "text": "In temples of God, families are eternally sealed through this power. Couples who enter into the Covenant of Eternal Marriage are sealed together, meaning that their union on earth is also valid in the heavens, rather than ending at death. Children who are subsequently born to them or later sealed to them are theirs for eternity… In addition, temple sealings are performed by proxy for the dead, with spouses sealed to each other and children sealed to parents."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cf7a4186-c58c-3a23-9e11-da10a8fb173d",
                                        "entry_id": "44c183cf-80e1-33bd-890b-60a0b9031fba",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To form a sacred commitment."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c14b1177-6d8c-4ecb-b789-f0ec17b687e0",
                                                "sense_id": "cf7a4186-c58c-3a23-9e11-da10a8fb173d",
                                                "text": "What was that office, or work, to which his Father sealed him? I answer, more generally, he was sealed to the whole work of mediation for us, thereby to recover and save all the elect, whom the Father had given him:"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ac9c5f56-2633-406c-ac75-a7af29f561d0",
                                                "sense_id": "cf7a4186-c58c-3a23-9e11-da10a8fb173d",
                                                "text": "Perfectly so, I tell thee, of the sealed people who have come in through unbelief, pretending themselves to be children of the kingdom, that they are sealed to be heirs of the promise, but have come in as thieves and robbers."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ae1c81d8-d0fe-41ba-bb76-51930500f4c8",
                                                "sense_id": "cf7a4186-c58c-3a23-9e11-da10a8fb173d",
                                                "text": "Let us all strive to get ourselves sealed to redemption, seeing God doth seal those whom he will deliver in that great day; if we be not in this number, we shall not escape damnation."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7bd7d3d9-d06f-4dd8-9cb8-d0ab84464fb0",
                                                "sense_id": "cf7a4186-c58c-3a23-9e11-da10a8fb173d",
                                                "text": "Thus these representatives of humanity are first sealed to help with the final work of salvation."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d8055bf3-71a2-3d1e-8890-58dedc03d702",
                                        "entry_id": "44c183cf-80e1-33bd-890b-60a0b9031fba",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To fry (meat) at a high temperature to retain the juices."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "837c25d5-e371-45c1-92cd-0d05418acbef",
                                                "sense_id": "d8055bf3-71a2-3d1e-8890-58dedc03d702",
                                                "text": "Seal the meat and continue frying until nicely browned."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "seal",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
